{
  "files": [
    {
      "script_id": "kl-divergence",
      "section_id": "ask",
      "line_id": "as-1",
      "filename": "ask-as-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/kl-divergence/xiaoxiao/ask-as-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.88,
      "size": 46080,
      "text": "上一课说清了熵是什么：用真实分布 p 设计编码时，每个符号所需的比特数下界。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "kl-divergence",
      "section_id": "ask",
      "line_id": "as-2",
      "filename": "ask-as-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/kl-divergence/xiaoxiao/ask-as-2.mp3",
      "duration": 4.11,
      "size": 65808,
      "text": "现在问下一个问题。如果我不知道真实分布，以为它是 q，按 q 设计了编码，但实际数据服从 p —— 要多花多少比特？"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "kl-divergence",
      "section_id": "ask",
      "line_id": "as-3",
      "filename": "ask-as-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/kl-divergence/xiaoxiao/ask-as-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.59,
      "size": 57456,
      "text": "这个\"多花的量\"就是 KL 散度，写作 D(p 双竖线 q)。式子是 p 乘以 p 比 q 的对数，求和。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "kl-divergence",
      "section_id": "ask",
      "line_id": "as-4",
      "filename": "ask-as-4.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/kl-divergence/xiaoxiao/ask-as-4.mp3",
      "duration": 4.55,
      "size": 72864,
      "text": "它还有一个更常见的名字。按 q 编码时的实际平均码长，叫交叉熵。而交叉熵恰好等于熵加 KL 散度 —— 下界加上浪费。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "kl-divergence",
      "section_id": "ask",
      "line_id": "as-5",
      "filename": "ask-as-5.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/kl-divergence/xiaoxiao/ask-as-5.mp3",
      "duration": 4.12,
      "size": 65952,
      "text": "项目里 logistic-regression 那课提了一句\"对数损失也叫交叉熵\"，但没说它和熵、和 KL 是什么关系。这门课补上。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "kl-divergence",
      "section_id": "gibbs",
      "line_id": "gb-1",
      "filename": "gibbs-gb-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/kl-divergence/xiaoxiao/gibbs-gb-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.77,
      "size": 60336,
      "text": "第一个要紧的性质：KL 散度永远非负，而且等于零当且仅当两个分布完全相同。这叫 Gibbs 不等式。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "kl-divergence",
      "section_id": "gibbs",
      "line_id": "gb-2",
      "filename": "gibbs-gb-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/kl-divergence/xiaoxiao/gibbs-gb-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.93,
      "size": 62928,
      "text": "直观含义很实在：用错分布只会更费，绝不会更省。真实分布是编码的最优选择，而且是唯一的最优。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "kl-divergence",
      "section_id": "gibbs",
      "line_id": "gb-3",
      "filename": "gibbs-gb-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/kl-divergence/xiaoxiao/gibbs-gb-3.mp3",
      "duration": 5.26,
      "size": 84240,
      "text": "画面上就是这件事的几何形态。底面三角形是所有的 q，高度是 D(p 双竖线 q)。整张曲面在 q 等于 p 的那一点触底，其余地方全都更高。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "kl-divergence",
      "section_id": "gibbs",
      "line_id": "gb-4",
      "filename": "gibbs-gb-4.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/kl-divergence/xiaoxiao/gibbs-gb-4.mp3",
      "duration": 3.18,
      "size": 50832,
      "text": "本课在单纯形上采了七百四十一个点验证：没有一个负值，最小值精确出现在 q 等于 p 处。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "kl-divergence",
      "section_id": "gibbs",
      "line_id": "gb-5",
      "filename": "gibbs-gb-5.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/kl-divergence/xiaoxiao/gibbs-gb-5.mp3",
      "duration": 5.38,
      "size": 86112,
      "text": "这条不等式的分量比看上去重。极大似然估计为什么是对的？因为最大化似然等价于最小化前向 KL，而 Gibbs 保证这个最小值只在真实分布处取到。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "kl-divergence",
      "section_id": "asym",
      "line_id": "am-1",
      "filename": "asym-am-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/kl-divergence/xiaoxiao/asym-am-1.mp3",
      "duration": 4.02,
      "size": 64368,
      "text": "第二个要紧的性质，也是初学最容易搞错的：KL 散度不对称。D(p 双竖线 q) 一般不等于 D(q 双竖线 p)。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "kl-divergence",
      "section_id": "asym",
      "line_id": "am-2",
      "filename": "asym-am-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/kl-divergence/xiaoxiao/asym-am-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.73,
      "size": 59616,
      "text": "切到\"不对称明显\"那个预设。同一对分布，一个方向是一点八五一，另一个方向是零点八五九，差了一倍多。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "kl-divergence",
      "section_id": "asym",
      "line_id": "am-3",
      "filename": "asym-am-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/kl-divergence/xiaoxiao/asym-am-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.12,
      "size": 65952,
      "text": "把两张曲面都打开看形状。蓝色那张在边界急剧升高，粉色那张平缓得多 —— 同一个 p，两个方向的\"罚法\"完全不同。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "kl-divergence",
      "section_id": "asym",
      "line_id": "am-4",
      "filename": "asym-am-4.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/kl-divergence/xiaoxiao/asym-am-4.mp3",
      "duration": 4.29,
      "size": 68688,
      "text": "不对称还只是其一。KL 连三角不等式都不满足，本课给了具体反例。所以它根本不是距离，叫\"散度\"是有道理的。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "kl-divergence",
      "section_id": "asym",
      "line_id": "am-5",
      "filename": "asym-am-5.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/kl-divergence/xiaoxiao/asym-am-5.mp3",
      "duration": 7.66,
      "size": 122544,
      "text": "那想要距离怎么办？有两个办法。一是 Jensen-Shannon 散度，取两个分布的平均当中介，两边各算一次 KL；它对称、有界、开方之后还满足三角不等式。二是总变差距离，直接算概率差的绝对值之和的一半。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "kl-divergence",
      "section_id": "infinity",
      "line_id": "if-1",
      "filename": "infinity-if-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/kl-divergence/xiaoxiao/infinity-if-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.2,
      "size": 35136,
      "text": "有一个退化情形必须单独说，因为它在实践中真的会出事。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "kl-divergence",
      "section_id": "infinity",
      "line_id": "if-2",
      "filename": "infinity-if-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/kl-divergence/xiaoxiao/infinity-if-2.mp3",
      "duration": 4.58,
      "size": 73296,
      "text": "如果某个 q 分量是零，而对应的 p 分量不是零，那么 KL 散度是**真正的无穷大** —— 不是数值溢出，是数学上就发散。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "kl-divergence",
      "section_id": "infinity",
      "line_id": "if-3",
      "filename": "infinity-if-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/kl-divergence/xiaoxiao/infinity-if-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.95,
      "size": 63216,
      "text": "含义很直白：你的模型认为某件事绝不可能发生，而它发生了。要给一个概率为零的事件编码，需要无穷多比特。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "kl-divergence",
      "section_id": "infinity",
      "line_id": "if-4",
      "filename": "infinity-if-4.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/kl-divergence/xiaoxiao/infinity-if-4.mp3",
      "duration": 6.08,
      "size": 97200,
      "text": "反过来则不然。p 的某个分量是零时，那一项按极限取零，结果照样有限。所以这个退化是**单向**的 —— 模型过于自信才是灾难，数据没覆盖到不是。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "kl-divergence",
      "section_id": "infinity",
      "line_id": "if-5",
      "filename": "infinity-if-5.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/kl-divergence/xiaoxiao/infinity-if-5.mp3",
      "duration": 4.72,
      "size": 75600,
      "text": "本课在界面上如实显示无穷大，不悄悄截断成一个大数。图上边界那圈淡色区域就是被截到显示上限的部分，实际高度是发散的。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "kl-divergence",
      "section_id": "infinity",
      "line_id": "if-6",
      "filename": "infinity-if-6.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/kl-divergence/xiaoxiao/infinity-if-6.mp3",
      "duration": 5.33,
      "size": 85248,
      "text": "这也是为什么实践中要做平滑 —— 给每个类别加一点点先验概率，避免模型输出精确的零。JS 散度则天然免疫，因为中介分布的支撑覆盖了两者。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "kl-divergence",
      "section_id": "ml",
      "line_id": "ml-1",
      "filename": "ml-ml-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/kl-divergence/xiaoxiao/ml-ml-1.mp3",
      "duration": 5.23,
      "size": 83664,
      "text": "交叉熵等于熵加 KL，而熵只跟真实数据有关、跟模型无关。所以训练时最小化交叉熵，和最小化 KL 散度是完全等价的 —— 差一个常数而已。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "kl-divergence",
      "section_id": "ml",
      "line_id": "ml-2",
      "filename": "ml-ml-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/kl-divergence/xiaoxiao/ml-ml-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.52,
      "size": 56304,
      "text": "这就解释了为什么所有分类模型的损失函数都是交叉熵：它本质上就是在让模型分布逼近真实分布。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "kl-divergence",
      "section_id": "ml",
      "line_id": "ml-3",
      "filename": "ml-ml-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/kl-divergence/xiaoxiao/ml-ml-3.mp3",
      "duration": 6.83,
      "size": 109296,
      "text": "但用哪个方向的 KL，结果很不一样。前向 KL，也就是 D(p 双竖线 q)，要求 p 有质量的地方 q 也必须有，否则罚到无穷。所以拟合出的 q 会尽量覆盖 p 的所有峰，趋向于取平均。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "kl-divergence",
      "section_id": "ml",
      "line_id": "ml-4",
      "filename": "ml-ml-4.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/kl-divergence/xiaoxiao/ml-ml-4.mp3",
      "duration": 5.1,
      "size": 81648,
      "text": "反向 KL，也就是 D(q 双竖线 p)，只在 q 自己有质量的地方受罚。所以 q 可以安心缩到 p 的某一个峰上，忽略其余的，趋向于挑一个模式。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "kl-divergence",
      "section_id": "ml",
      "line_id": "ml-5",
      "filename": "ml-ml-5.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/kl-divergence/xiaoxiao/ml-ml-5.mp3",
      "duration": 6.6,
      "size": 105552,
      "text": "实际后果：极大似然用的是前向，所以拟合多峰分布时会得到一个覆盖全体的宽分布；变分推断用的是反向，所以常常低估方差、只抓住一个模式。这不是算法的 bug，是选了哪个方向决定的。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "kl-divergence",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-1",
      "filename": "summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/kl-divergence/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "duration": 4.29,
      "size": 68688,
      "text": "KL 散度是用错分布多付的比特数。Gibbs 不等式保证它非负，且只在两个分布相同时为零 —— 这是极大似然的理论根据。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "kl-divergence",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-2",
      "filename": "summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/kl-divergence/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "duration": 4.71,
      "size": 75312,
      "text": "它不对称，也不满足三角不等式，所以不是距离。要距离可以用 JS 散度或总变差。q 为零而 p 不为零时是真正的无穷大。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "kl-divergence",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-3",
      "filename": "summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/kl-divergence/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "duration": 5.32,
      "size": 85104,
      "text": "交叉熵等于熵加 KL，熵与模型无关，所以最小化交叉熵就是最小化 KL。前向趋向覆盖，反向趋向挑一个峰 —— 用哪个方向，结果会很不一样。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "kl-divergence",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-4",
      "filename": "summary-sum-4.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/kl-divergence/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-4.mp3",
      "duration": 0.9,
      "size": 14400,
      "text": "继续探索数学之美！"
    }
  ],
